# LimeCab task surfaces

Before changing the sheet, map slot, SheetActions, trip pill, or payment UI, read `.ux-bugs/HANDOFF-surfaces.md`.

## Layout (task, mobile)

```
[destination bar] overlay
[map] full-bleed canvas UNDER the sheet
[sheet [scrollable content] + [constrained action band]]
```

Pad the camera for the sheet. Do not shrink the map box with `--map-overlay-bottom`. Do not round the task map.

## Actions

Confirm / payment ribbon: progressive disclosure, ribbon + one primary, pinned to the **visible** sheet bottom. No portal into a JS-measured 100dvh drawer.

## Live ride Back

Not `go("back")` (that is a no-op on committed states). Named actions `minimizeRide` / `restoreRide`: Home + tab bar + `LimeCabTripPill`. Pill restores the sheet. Cancel stays a separate interrupt.

## Payments

Fullscreen overlay (TaskScene-class), not `compact-interrupt`. List methods; bottom action **Add payment method**. Return restores the ride sheet.
